ASET-CAUSAL-NET 1 ASET-NETWORK-FEDERATION-ALPHA4-CAUSAL
SEMANTIC-PRECEDENCE NONE
MODE STATE-TRANSITION

TRANSITION FEDERATION-GENESIS ASET-NETWORK-FEDERATION-GENESIS
REQUIRE EMPTY_FEDERATION
EFFECT CREATE_FEDERATION
EFFECT PRESERVE_NETWORK
OUTPUT CODE FEDERATION_CREATED
END

TRANSITION MEMBER-JOIN ASET-NETWORK-MEMBER-JOIN
REQUIRE FEDERATION_EXISTS
REQUIRE MEMBER_ABSENT
EFFECT ADD_MEMBER
EFFECT PRESERVE_NETWORK
OUTPUT CODE MEMBER_JOINED
END

TRANSITION ROUTE-GRANT ASET-NETWORK-ROUTE-GRANT
REQUIRE ACTIVE_MEMBERS
REQUIRE DISTINCT_ENDPOINTS
REQUIRE ROUTE_ABSENT
EFFECT ADD_ACTIVE_ROUTE
EFFECT PRESERVE_NETWORK
OUTPUT CODE ROUTE_GRANTED
END

TRANSITION EXPORT-ARTIFACT ASET-NETWORK-EXPORT-ARTIFACT
REQUIRE ACTIVE_ROUTE
REQUIRE EXPORT_ABSENT
EFFECT ADD_EXPORT
EFFECT PRESERVE_NETWORK
OUTPUT CODE ARTIFACT_EXPORTED
END

TRANSITION SUSPEND-ROUTE ASET-NETWORK-SUSPEND-ROUTE
REQUIRE ACTIVE_ROUTE
EFFECT SUSPEND_ACTIVE_ROUTE
EFFECT PRESERVE_NETWORK
OUTPUT CODE ROUTE_SUSPENDED
END

TRANSITION MEMBER-WITHDRAW ASET-NETWORK-MEMBER-WITHDRAW
REQUIRE ACTIVE_MEMBER
REQUIRE NO_ACTIVE_ROUTE
EFFECT WITHDRAW_MEMBER
EFFECT PRESERVE_NETWORK
OUTPUT CODE MEMBER_WITHDRAWN
END
